    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="73.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 73.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gelæste ælc wuduwe ða heregeata binnon twelf monðum, buton hyre ær to onhagie, witeleas.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every widow shall pay the heriots within twelve months without incurring a fine, if it has not been convenient for her to pay earlier.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gelæste ælc wuduwe þa heregeatu binnan XII monðum, butan hyre ær to onhagige, wíteleas.</ab>
      </div>
